_at":"2026-05-05T16:37:56Z","closed_at":"2026-05-05T15:33:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119154","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119154.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119154.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-05T15:33:51Z"},"body":"- Supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102248\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100152 (it opens if it was closed but doesn't switch to anymore)\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99772\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758\r\n\r\nWhen opening the inspector and a shader resource is unfolded, now it only edits it and makes sure the dock isn't closed. Only when the user directly unfolds the resource section does the Shader Editor dock get switched to and focused.\r\n\r\nThe new unexposed `EditorPlugin::set_current` is only for ShaderEditor for now, I don't think other docks really have this issue, but it basically does what `make_visible` true did. I didn't want to change `make_visible` itself for compatibility.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","re